{
  "description": "ValidatingAdmissionPolicy (rbac-guardrails) + admission webhook health. Real denies vs policy CEL errors, webhook request/rejection/latency, fail-open counts.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [
        "tockmox"
      ],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Tockmox dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "description": "ValidatingAdmissionPolicy denials that are actual policy decisions: enforcement_action deny with error_type invalid_error, which is how the apiserver labels an ordinary violation (it never emits an empty error_type; an earlier version of this panel filtered for one and always read 0, TM-0976). compile_error and out_of_budget denials are CEL errors and are counted on the CEL errors panel instead. Known limit: a runtime CEL error under failurePolicy Fail carries the same labels as a violation, so it is counted here.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(apiserver_validating_admission_policy_check_total{job=\"apiserver\", enforcement_action=\"deny\", error_type=\"invalid_error\"}[$__range])) OR on() vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "VAP real denies (selected range)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "Policy CEL that failed to compile or ran out of cost budget (error_type compile_error or out_of_budget), plus any evaluation error under failurePolicy Ignore (enforcement_action allow with error_type invalid_error). An ordinary violation is NOT counted: the apiserver labels it invalid_error too, with enforcement_action deny, audit or warn (TM-0914). Not counted: a runtime CEL error under failurePolicy Fail, which the metric labels like a violation.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.001
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(apiserver_validating_admission_policy_check_total{job=\"apiserver\", error_type=~\"compile_error|out_of_budget\"}[5m])) OR on() vector(0)) + (sum(rate(apiserver_validating_admission_policy_check_total{job=\"apiserver\", enforcement_action=\"allow\", error_type=\"invalid_error\"}[5m])) OR on() vector(0))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "VAP CEL errors (rate/5m)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(apiserver_admission_webhook_rejection_count{job=\"apiserver\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Webhook rejections (selected range)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Window follows the dashboard's time range. It was a fixed [24h], which on a cluster younger than the window makes increase() extrapolate: a healthy 12-minute-old install rendered 'Webhook fail-open events (24h): 74.2' in red, and none of those events happened. Measured 2026-09-12."
    },
    {
      "description": "Observed counter delta across the selected range: max_over_time minus min_over_time. Deliberately NOT increase(), which extrapolates across the full range and therefore reports a fractional count of events that never happened on any cluster younger than the window ... 74.2 on 2026-09-12 and 70.2 on 2026-09-15, both on healthy clusters where no webhook had failed open (TM-0532). Switching the window to $__range in 2026-09-13 fixed the title, not the extrapolation, because the dashboard's default range is 24h.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(max_over_time(apiserver_admission_webhook_fail_open_count{job=\"apiserver\"}[$__range])) - sum(min_over_time(apiserver_admission_webhook_fail_open_count{job=\"apiserver\"}[$__range]))) OR on() vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Webhook fail-open events (selected range, observed)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "Rows are per-second rates over the trailing 5 minutes, at the moment the panel was evaluated ... not counts, and not the selected range. Zero-rate series are filtered out (`> 0`) so that a row appearing here means something is happening now. Before 2026-09-15 a dormant `error_type` label combination rendered identically to an active one and read as a finding (TM-0644).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "Value"
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (policy, enforcement_action, error_type) (rate(apiserver_validating_admission_policy_check_total{job=\"apiserver\"}[5m])) > 0",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "VAP checks by policy (rate/5m > 0, split by action + error_type)",
      "type": "table",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "policy": 0,
              "enforcement_action": 1,
              "error_type": 2,
              "Value": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "enforcement_action": "action",
              "error_type": "error"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "policy"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.wrapText",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^(action|enforcement_action)$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^(error|error_type)$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 125
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Value"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 95
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (name) (rate(apiserver_admission_webhook_request_total{job=\"apiserver\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Admission webhook request rate by name",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, name) (rate(apiserver_admission_webhook_admission_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"apiserver\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Admission webhook latency p99 by name",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "5m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "platform",
    "tockmox",
    "security",
    "admission"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "type": "datasource"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "title": "Tockmox / Admission & Policy",
  "uid": "tockmox-admission"
}
